# Kick-Bass — 150 bpm, F minor. A demo of the kick that is also the bass,
# the supersaw wall and the noise riser.
#
# The kick track plays the BASSLINE: every hit dives four octaves onto its
# note (pitch_env, pitch_env_time, pitch_env_curve), key sync restarts it
# at the same phase each time, 30 dB of drive squares it off, and the
# ladder after the drive is the post-filter. The tail holds the note, so
# F1 / G#1 / C2 under the chords is the harmony. The dive and the tail
# shape separately: automate the dive (kick.pitch_env_time) without
# touching the tail (kick.decay, kick.cutoff).
#
#   beats  0-16   BUILD   the kick alone, a riser sweeping its own noise
#   beats 16-48   DROP    the superwall opens; at 32 the wavefolder kick
#                         (rawkick) takes the line and screeches
#   beats 48-64   BOOM    808 kicks, long, the tail ringing on the note

bpm 150
gate 0.9
tail 2

section BUILD 0..16
section DROP 16..48
section BOOM 48..64

automate reverb_wet
0.12
automate reverb_decay
0.7
automate tape_drive
0.25
automate comp_in
1
automate comp_threshold
-16
automate hh_level
0.55

track kick patch=hardkick vel=0.95 gain=1.2
(F1 F1 F1 F1 | F1 F1 G#1 F1 | F1 F1 F1 F1 | C2 C2 G#1 D#1)
(F1 F1 F1 F1 | C#2 C#2 C#2 C#2 | G#1 G#1 G#1 G#1 | D#1 D#1 D#1 D#2)

# the dive gets longer through the build, then snaps tight for the drop
automate kick.pitch_env_time
0.06 0.14:15@smooth 0.1:1@step

# the second half of the drop hands the line to the wavefolder kick,
# its drive climbing into the screech
track screech patch=rawkick vel=0.9 gain=0.9
>32 (F1 F1 F1 F1 | C#2 C#2 C#2 C#2 | G#1 G#1 G#1 G#1 | D#1 D#1 D#1 D#2)
automate screech.shaper
26 >32 26 38:16@smooth

track boom patch=kick808 vel=0.9 gain=1.4
>BOOM F1:3 F1:1 | C#2:4 | G#1:2 G#1:2 | D#1:4

track hats kit=909 len=0.5 gain=0.8
>4 (R CH R CH R CH R OH)x15

track claps kit=hats len=1
>DROP (R CP R CP)x8

track wall patch=superwall vel=0.55 gain=0.5 reverb_send=0.3
>DROP [F3 G#3 C4 F4]:8 [C#3 F3 G#3 C#4]:8 [G#2 C3 D#3 G#3]:8 [D#3 G3 A#3 D#4]:8
[F3 G#3 C4 F4]:16
automate wall.supersaw_detune
0.2 >DROP 0.2 0.55:32@smooth
automate wall.cutoff
900 >DROP 900 6000:8@exp R:24 1200:16@exp

track riser patch=riser vel=0.7 gain=0.8 reverb_send=0.4
[F3]:16
automate riser.noise_cutoff
300 9000:16@exp
